@startuml UC-14
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-14.md
title UC-14: Product Listing
footer Feature CAT-02 | Business rules: BR-10, BR-14
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Guest / Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "OData/ProductsController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ProductService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open product list (optional category, page)
MVC -> API : GET /odata/products?$filter=CategoryId eq {categoryId}&$top=20&$skip={offset}&$count=true
API -> SVC : QueryProducts()
SVC --> API : IQueryable<ProductListDto>\n(active products only, EffectivePrice, IsOnSale) (BR-10, BR-14)
API -> DB : Apply OData options and execute query
DB --> API : Matching rows (+ total count)
API --> MVC : 200 OK { value, @odata.count }
alt no results
  MVC --> U : Show "No products found"
else results found
  MVC --> U : Show product cards\n(name, thumbnail, effective price, base price if on sale, rating)
end

U -> MVC : Go to another page
MVC -> API : GET /odata/products?...&$skip={nextOffset}
API --> MVC : 200 OK (next page)
MVC --> U : Show next page

@enduml
